irst and urination. These are usually early signs that something's off with how the body is processing sugar. Then, as it progresses, people might notice more noticeable symptoms like fatigue, blurred vision, or slow healing wounds.\n","\n","Now, what about the diagnostic criteria? Let's see, I know that the American Diabetes Association (ADA) sets the standards for diagnosing Type 2 Diabetes. They use a combination of tests to confirm it. First, there's the fasting plasma glucose (FPG) test. If someone's FPG is 126 mg/dL or higher, it's a sign that they have diabetes.\n","\n","Oh, and then there's the oral glucose tolerance test (OGTT). This is where they give someone a sugary drink, and then check their blood glucose levels an hour later. If it's 200 mg/dL or higher, that's another sign of diabetes.\n","\n","But wait,\n"]}]},{"cell_type":"code","source":["from huggingface_hub import upload_folder, create_repo\n","\n","# Correct Username set karein (sajalsheraz75)\n","repo_id = \"sajalsheraz75/medical-llama-3-8b-adapter\"\n","local_dir = \"medical_llama3_adapter\"\n","\n","# Create Repository & Upload Folder\n","create_repo(repo_id=repo_id, repo_type=\"model\", exist_ok=True)\n","\n","upload_folder(\n","    folder_path=local_dir,\n","    repo_id=repo_id,\n","    repo_type=\"model\",\n","    commit_message=\"Upload medical fine-tuned LoRA adapter\"\n",")"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/","height":547},"id":"rDSKl1Db9a5h","executionInfo":{"status":"error","timestamp":1787947483060,"user_tz":-300,"elapsed":1254,"user":{"displayName":"Sajal Sheraz","userId":"11388105188771150832"}},"outputId":"4f70829d-31d0-4834-8903-5fc715afd7fd"},"execution_count":10,"outputs":[{"output_type":"error","ename":"RepositoryNotFoundError","evalue":"401 Client Error. (Request ID: Root=1-6a91e9d9-15d522c3147ceb3021441698;bd5fbf91-cc3d-4828-8c09-5d33fe7158da)\n\nRepository Not Found for url: https://huggingface.co/api/models/sajalsheraz75/medical-llama-3-8b-adapter/